1
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:10,630
- Although I moved to Seoul at a late age

2
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:13,390
- My heart flutters at my first independence

3
00:00:14,220 --> 00:00:16,350
- My room, my home

4
00:00:25,190 --> 00:00:26,230
- Oh, Mom

5
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:28,950
- Oh, you arrived well

6
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,910
- Then, don't worry

7
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:50,550
Huh?

8
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:53,260
Who?

9
00:00:54,430 --> 00:00:57,270
I'm the tenant who was supposed to come in today

10
00:00:57,970 --> 00:00:59,980
- Mom, I'll call you again later

11
00:01:05,190 --> 00:01:06,270
Hold on a second

12
00:01:15,620 --> 00:01:16,950
Ma'am

13
00:01:17,580 --> 00:01:18,950
What is going on right now?

14
00:01:22,170 --> 00:01:22,960
Again?

15
00:01:23,830 --> 00:01:26,250
I renewed the contract last month, remember?

16
00:01:28,590 --> 00:01:29,130
What?

17
00:01:30,840 --> 00:01:33,050
You signed a contract with this friend too?

18
00:01:40,720 --> 00:01:42,850
Got it, I'm hanging up

19
00:01:49,320 --> 00:01:52,280
Did I do something wrong?

20
00:01:52,740 --> 00:01:54,660
Have you heard of double contracting?

21
00:01:55,990 --> 00:01:57,200
Double contracting...

22
00:01:58,490 --> 00:01:59,700
I've heard of it

23
00:02:03,460 --> 00:02:05,750
That's our situation right now

24
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,340
Double contract

25
00:02:09,250 --> 00:02:09,750
What?

26
00:02:10,710 --> 00:02:11,920
So what now?

27
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:16,390
Well, you could try talking to the landlady

28
00:02:16,390 --> 00:02:18,350
and see if you can get your deposit back

29
00:02:19,140 --> 00:02:20,850
But I heard you're going abroad now?

30
00:02:20,970 --> 00:02:22,980
Since you mentioned the airport

31
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:25,980
I guess you might be able to get it back around next month?

32
00:02:26,900 --> 00:02:27,980
Then

33
00:02:30,900 --> 00:02:32,440
What, are you going to live with me?

34
00:02:33,150 --> 00:02:33,940
What?

35
00:02:36,410 --> 00:02:38,490
It seems like there’s nowhere to go

36
00:02:38,820 --> 00:02:40,530
Just live here with me

37
00:02:42,370 --> 00:02:44,160
I'm glad, though

38
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:46,960
But why do you keep speaking informally?

39
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:49,960
I see you're younger than me

40
00:02:50,210 --> 00:02:52,130
If you have a complaint, you can speak informally too

41
00:02:53,670 --> 00:02:55,260
Oh no, that's not it

42
00:02:57,430 --> 00:02:58,970
One room here

43
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:02,720
The living room is too small to even lay out a mattress

44
00:03:04,730 --> 00:03:06,520
Then what should I do?

45
00:03:08,690 --> 00:03:09,980
Don't just stand there

46
00:03:10,190 --> 00:03:11,980
Just come in for now

47
00:03:17,990 --> 00:03:19,030
- Seoul...

48
00:03:19,950 --> 00:03:21,870
- And from the first day

49
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:24,450
- Sharing a room with a stranger woman...

50
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:41,260
Look

51
00:03:41,390 --> 00:03:42,350
One room

52
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,810
One bed

53
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:48,690
It's not that big

54
00:03:51,230 --> 00:03:54,030
You didn't come expecting a hotel suite or anything, did you?

55
00:03:58,450 --> 00:03:59,860
Just put your luggage over there for now

56
00:04:00,160 --> 00:04:01,990
We have to sleep together anyway today

57
00:04:03,330 --> 00:04:04,410
What?

58
00:04:04,700 --> 00:04:05,500
Shall we sleep together?

59
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:08,160
Yes, there's only one bed

60
00:04:08,750 --> 00:04:10,420
Are you planning to sleep on the floor?

61
00:04:11,750 --> 00:04:14,000
Oh, I'm fine with sleeping on the floor

62
00:04:14,210 --> 00:04:16,000
I hope it's not inconvenient for you

63
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,630
Sleeping on the floor hurts my back

64
00:04:20,630 --> 00:04:22,350
Is it uncomfortable to sleep with me?

65
00:04:23,720 --> 00:04:25,010
No

66
00:04:25,970 --> 00:04:26,890
That's not it

67
00:04:28,770 --> 00:04:32,060
I mean, don't worry about it

68
00:04:35,900 --> 00:04:37,650
I don't care, so it's fine with me

69
00:05:11,890 --> 00:05:12,640
Why?

70
00:05:13,600 --> 00:05:15,860
Are you nervous about sleeping together from the first day?

71
00:05:18,150 --> 00:05:20,070
No, it's not like that...

72
00:05:22,150 --> 00:05:23,320
Lie

73
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:25,450
It's true!

74
00:05:37,840 --> 00:05:39,000
Don't worry

75
00:05:41,170 --> 00:05:42,800
I don't eat people

76
00:05:48,310 --> 00:05:48,970
Shower

77
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:50,810
Do you want to go first?

78
00:05:58,730 --> 00:06:01,240
It's uncomfortable because I can tell you're nervous

79
00:06:03,650 --> 00:06:06,320
Can I go wash up first?

80
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:07,320
Yes

81
00:06:08,120 --> 00:06:09,870
The towel is in the left drawer of the bathroom

82
00:06:11,500 --> 00:06:12,830
Ah, yes

83
00:06:18,840 --> 00:06:21,420
You're totally cute!

84
00:06:36,560 --> 00:06:37,560
What is it?

85
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:42,360
Don't you like this kind of thing?

86
00:07:08,090 --> 00:07:09,930
If you live honestly

87
00:07:11,010 --> 00:07:12,510
It's boring

88
00:07:14,100 --> 00:07:17,020
Isn't it more fun to go down an unknown path?

89
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:21,110
Still

90
00:07:22,730 --> 00:07:25,400
This is too dangerous

91
00:07:27,820 --> 00:07:30,160
It's more fun because it's dangerous

92
00:07:31,160 --> 00:07:33,160
That lingering feeling lasts even longer

93
00:07:35,410 --> 00:07:36,870
Today is

94
00:07:38,170 --> 00:07:40,290
Try to think of it as you, not someone else
